    <!-- How it works -->
    <string name="how_it_works">How it works?</string>
    <string name="how_it_works_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="how_it_works_text">• Service listens for screen off event and posts a fullscreen notification (like an alarm) to show the clock over the lock screen\n\n• Screen brightness is set to 0 to prevent frontlight flash — e-ink performs a refresh\n\n• WakeLock expires → screen sleeps, e-ink retains the clock image\n\n• Clock updates periodically via AlarmManager at the configured interval\n\n• Weather, news, and book data update in the background at their own intervals\n\n• Unlock via fingerprint sensor — instant unlock with vibration feedback\n\nImportant: make sure the \"Lock screen clock\" notification channel is enabled in notification settings</string>

